docs {
  ## Instances

  List loaded instances.

  - Method and path: `GET /api/v1/instances?limit=100`.
  - Path parameters: none.
  - Query parameters: `limit` (optional). 0, invalid, or missing values use `100`; values above
    `100` clamp to `100`.
  - Body: none.
  - Signature headers: `X-GM-Timestamp`, `X-GM-Nonce`, `X-GM-Signature`, set by `collection.bru`.
    No `X-GM-Actor`, no RBAC permission.
  - Success: `200` with an array of
    `{"instance_id","map_id","difficulty","players"}`, ordered by instance id.
  - Failure: `401 unauthorized`, `405 method_not_allowed`, `409 replayed_nonce`,
    `429 rate_limited`, `503 world_unavailable`.

  Only loaded maps with a non-zero instance id are returned. The read runs on the world thread; a
  stalled world thread returns `503`.
}
